/-!
# First concrete musl-startup decode boundary

Generated from the pinned QEMU single-instruction trace in
`examples/verification-projects/x86-musl-startup`. These theorems check exact
byte spans against the local decoder; they do not establish execution or a
hardware correspondence. The ELF/trace binding is checked by the Python lane.
-/

@[expose] public section
set_option autoImplicit false

namespace Silmaril.X86.Ext.Wire.MuslStartupCoverage

open Silmaril.X86 (Byte)

